\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3.21}{\ignorespaces The four relative pointing noise degrees of freedom for the the beam into the PMC was measured with the DBB. The requirement \cite  {PSL_pointing_requirement} is shown in light blue. The pointing noise is above the requirement, however the TnT lab has a higher amount of environmental noise, this pointing noise will be less in the PSL. Measurements below 100\tmspace  +\thinmuskip {.1667em}Hz may be affected by scattering.\relax }}{46}{figure.caption.60}}
\newlabel{fig:ligolaserchapterpointingnoise}{{3.21}{46}{The four relative pointing noise degrees of freedom for the the beam into the PMC was measured with the DBB. The requirement \cite {PSL_pointing_requirement} is shown in light blue. The pointing noise is above the requirement, however the TnT lab has a higher amount of environmental noise, this pointing noise will be less in the PSL. Measurements below 100\,Hz may be affected by scattering.\relax }{figure.caption.60}{}}
